  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your are able to channel the forces of the cosmos to tame the raging elemental energies within</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Two maneuvers known of two different disciplines, essence pool 1</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you would spend animus or tempo points, you may take an amount of essence burn equal to the number of points which would be spent to trigger the effect as if you had expended a number of points without actually expending any. In addition, whenever you reassign essence, you may spend animus or tempo points to gain an amount of temporary essence equal to half the number of points spent for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>In addition, you gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
